          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="War-driven disruptions and price spikes in global energy markets raise operating costs and supply-risk premiums for energy‑intensive manufacturers in affected markets, prompting firms to shift production and supply‑chain nodes toward lower‑cost or more energy‑secure locations." />
