          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.68" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Greater policy coordination among the US and its Northeast Asian allies in response to DPRK escalation yields synchronized export controls, investment screening and sanctions targeting technology and logistics links, increasing the frequency and severity of regulatory actions that shape US–China economic competition." />
