          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sharp escalation by North Korea prompts governments to broaden sanctions and export controls and to fast-track AI governance and oversight measures on national-security grounds, raising overall regulatory pressure on commercial AI activity." />
