          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Heightened and broadened sanctions tied to North Korean networks raise secondary‑sanctions risk for firms and financial intermediaries operating through or with Chinese counterparties, prompting multinational firms to accelerate shifting production or supply nodes to lower‑risk jurisdictions." />
