          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Increased flow of dual-use cyber and AI-related tools from or via actors linked to North Korean escalation enables state and non-state operators to deploy or weaponize AI systems more widely, increasing the frequency and severity of safety and security incidents." />
