          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rapid transfers or visible proliferation of North Korean missile/dual‑use tech to regional proxies prompt the US to escalate counterproliferation diplomacy and pressure China to police transfers, producing an observable rise in US–China strategic contestation." />
