          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A noticeable rise in North Korean defense production that alters threat perceptions and forces reallocation of naval escorts raises perceived transit risk and causes insurers to increase war-risk and marine premiums for vessels operating in adjacent high-risk sea lanes." />
