          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Noticeable increases in North Korean weapons production and strike capability raise near‑term conflict and disruption risk in Northeast Asia, depressing foreign investor willingness to add or retain exposure to regional markets closely tied to China and its supply chains." />
